{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "02LB", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-application-descending-properties-morphisms}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b0cc85e49a2b72a9f14871338ba2e593f4622c697ac103a148871c7dfdab1afc", "source_text": "Application of fpqc descent of properties of morphisms", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fb32671e2089b6b43d302b09781200b104cedad7abbecb116c59f3bcaa582ca2", "unit_id": "tag:02LB:title"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02LB", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7ec2f8a52d97f9ba8095c3153c7e4fa05b724cf007a14b3978e3d40877cda711", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following lemma may seem a bit frivolous but turns out is a useful\ntool in studying <ACCENT_0001>tale and unramified morphisms.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a5b7a23ab1ea91f9f13ac5fc054ee6a660b09c2220e5a37e2204f05158dec147", "unit_id": "tag:02LB:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02LB", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-flat-surjective-quasi-compact-monomorphism-isomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7d02639f80922e12b2e634e8eec9a4f42e63ddd79e4f1836a1573379092ecabe", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6f17ad1f6dd41bb477a9e8053ecf07bfae6e33b4078028ce18b19fd041455864", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a flat, quasi-compact, surjective monomorphism.\nThen f is an isomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a2ea14409d369c6b2a15967366da9a205c69999f5547047a9a7121d129d121c1", "unit_id": "tag:06NC:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02LB", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f$", "MATH_0002": "$\\{X \\to Y\\}$", "MATH_0003": "$Y$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Delta : X \\to X \\times_Y X$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$f$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-monomorphism}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-isomorphism}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ff0851848784debd568ea8e7a08e64b6c227b42427189b3e97e15a0ef70e9c89", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d3ec694d1eec4ac0c2b7db53a40ad27cea73d48bd87566a7da5a760419be2c2b", "source_text": "As <MATH_0001> is a flat, quasi-compact, surjective morphism\nwe see <MATH_0002> is an fpqc covering of <MATH_0003>.\nThe diagonal <MATH_0004> is an isomorphism\n(Schemes, Lemma <REF_0001>).\nThis implies that the base change of <MATH_0005> by <MATH_0006> is an\nisomorphism. Hence we see <MATH_0007> is an isomorphism by\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1ba9d6472d1708a16d5f49282ff0ba44f9ac63c1d75611ad1dedfab440915132", "unit_id": "tag:06NC:proof"}
